  "details": "<p>This place ought not to be confused with the similarly named <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/452293\" target=\"_self\" title=\"Castra Hannibalis\">Castra Hannibalis</a> located in Bruttium.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Castra Aniba, or Castra Hannibalis, is now unlocated but was a place in Campania located between Capua and Mount Tifata. It is included on the Peutinger map and is mentioned by the Ravenna Cosmographer. Its precise location can no longer be determined.",
